{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111387","id":2895631447,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6sl9RX","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111387","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111387.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111387.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111387","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111387/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111387/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111387/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/49efe2b3b854f34277529d1406509001bd0da471","number":111387,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix `load_threaded_get` returning `null` when used with `CACHE_MODE_IGNORE`","user":{"login":"Chaosed0","id":2808430,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4MDg0MzA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2808430?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosed0","html_url":"https://github.com/Chaosed0","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosed0/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosed0/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosed0/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosed0/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosed0/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosed0/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosed0/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosed0/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosed0/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"In rare cases, calling `ResourceLoader.load_threaded_request` with `CACHE_MODE_IGNORE` can cause `ResourceLoader.load_threaded_get` to return a null resource, or - in even rarer cases - loop forever.\r\n\r\nMore context for the problem can be [found in this issue](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111385), which also contains an MRP.\r\n\r\n*Bugsquad edit:* Fixes #111385.\r\n\r\nIn essence, the problem is a race condition between the loading of a scene containing a resource, and the loading of that resource directly. For full context, we must inspect the winding chain of calls that occurs in code:\r\n\r\n- The caller calls `load_threaded_request` attempting to load a resource that depends on some external resources. For this example, let's assume it's a scene that references a texture, but it could be any external resource.\r\n- `ResourceLoader` begins loading the scene. This causes the texture to also get loaded, invoked from `ResourceLoaderText.load`.\r\n  - Inside the call to `_load_start`, a `ThreadLoadTask` for the loading of the texture is stored into `thread_load_tasks`.\r\n- Before this load completes, we receive a new call to `load_threaded_request` with `CACHE_MODE_IGNORE`. This time, the caller attempts to load the texture directly.\r\n  - Within `_load_start`, there is a branch (line 641) that checks if we are ignoring the cache, but are already loading the resource. In this case, we generate a new load task and assign it to `load_token->task_if_unregistered`, but leave the `thread_load_tasks` map untouched.\r\n- The task to load the texture within the scene completes (but the task to load the texture directly is still running).\r\n- Directly after this, the caller calls `load_threaded_get_status` with the texture's path, intending to get the load status of the texture. However, `load_threaded_get_status` checks `thread_load_tasks`, which contains the _finished_ task which was loading the texture for the scene.\r\n- Finally, the caller calls `load_threaded_get`, thinking that the load is finished. However, inside `_load_complete_inner`, we use `p_load_token.task_if_unregistered`, which is the task for the texture that was loaded directly, and _not_ the finished task inside `thread_load_tasks` which both `load_threaded_get` and `load_threaded_get_status` were inspecting. Since this task is not yet finished, it returns a null resource.\r\n\r\nIt can get even worse in the last step if the task inside `thread_load_tasks` happened to get destructed before we reach that point (i.e. because the scene loading completed and cleaned up). If that is the case, the while loop within `load_threaded_get` can loop forever, as we pull a default-constructed `ThreadLoadTask` out of `thread_load_tasks` which always has a status of `THREAD_LOAD_IN_PROGRESS`.\r\n\r\nTo fix this, I changed the code to always use `load_token->task_if_unregistered` if it is non-null. That way, calls that ignore the cache should always check the correct task for their status & result.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/23","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23/labels","number":23,"state":"closed","title":"4.6","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/R